  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53857 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Spanish-Site-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"229\"/></p>\n<h3><strong>Spanish Language Site</strong></h3>\n<p>We launched our Spanish language NutritionFacts.org and social media pages almost one year ago, and since then we have reached tens of thousands more people around the world. Now people can simply go to <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/es?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://NutritionFacts.org/es?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527799797752000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFdefyGQJqW2R35Bi81P0aj9bAuzQ\">NutritionFacts.org/es</a> and find our videos, transcripts, doctor’s notes, and other pages all en español.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53865 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/16-Languages-1-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"198\"/></p>\n<h3><strong>Video Caption Translations</strong></h3>\n<p>But that’s not the only way to see NutritionFacts.org in other languages. Over 80 volunteers spend time translating video captions into more than 16 languages. To find out if a video is translated into your language, hover over the video, click on the cog wheel, and select “subtitles.”  To become a translation volunteer, apply <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527799797752000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFVC47dtoyLvrjmI3eb7zj0jSQK8Q\">here</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53869 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/IMG_5922-960x1279.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"302\"/></p>\n<h3><strong>How Not to Die Book Translations</strong></h3>\n<p>When<em> How Not to Die</em> was published just over three years ago, I really had no idea if anyone would read it. I knew it could be an important way to get the research out beyond the NutritionFacts.org website, and I am thrilled that it has now been translated and distributed in 28 languages.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53875 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/maxresdefault-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"209\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/maxresdefault-1.png 644w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/maxresdefault-1-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/maxresdefault-1-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></p>\n<h3><strong>#DailyDozenChallenge Going Strong</strong></h3>\n<p>People all over the world are completing the Daily Dozen Challenge and posting about it on YouTube and social media.  Have you taken the challenge? Go <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen-challenge/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen-challenge/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527799797752000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGgJsmvW8ipNEhv8ysasaW-kFrDDg\">here</a> to find out how. And for inspiration, check out our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5TLzNi5fYd_UG_KSb-xAD8FifmKuEKuh&amp;utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list%3DPL5TLzNi5fYd_UG_KSb-xAD8FifmKuEKuh%26utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527799797752000&amp;usg=AFQjCNE1cL3fFz9MV22GFeKAEduJrpOtkA\">playlist</a> of fan-made videos and search the #dailydozenchallenge hashtag on Instagram. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53480 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/Were-HiringIG.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\"/></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>We’re Hiring</strong></h3>\n<p>We’re excited to be able to open up a new position at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527799797752000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGpbFOWAY4CwBQ40pjuo9zmn_btBg\">NutritionFacts.org</a>. We’re looking for an experienced part-time Digital Marketing Manager to enhance our global reach. </p>\n<p>Read about the role and apply <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/employment?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/employment?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527799797752000&amp;usg=AFQjCNE05xXpgYS_9GUErbdD-srwEdSnxw\">here</a>. (Update: This role has been filled)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-53877 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/mary-harris-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"223\"/></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Welcome, Mary!<br/>\n</strong>Mary joins the team as our Media and Events Director, with over ten years of experience in public relations, <a href=\"https://serpninja.io/\">SEO</a>, and marketing and seven years teaching in higher education. She is passionate about plants – growing them, cooking with them, and teaching people about their many health benefits – and she is honored to be a part of the NutritionFacts team</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"256\"/></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>Live Q&amp;As <span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1210885334\"><span class=\"aQJ\">June 28th</span></span></strong></h3>\n<p>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong><span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1210885335\"><span class=\"aQJ\">June 28th</span></span></strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At <span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1210885336\"><span class=\"aQJ\">1:00 p.m. ET</span></span> go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527803195577000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFI9bV-cWIvIrc7haJ9jDy-u5S0kA\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At <span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1210885337\"><span class=\"aQJ\">1:30 p.m. ET</span></span>go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_CnduccKn_A&amp;utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3D_CnduccKn_A%26utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527803195577000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEoikUgpU9kEbTC9gR8bLIoaOhE7g\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/live/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527803195577000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEYrSRIVtyjdwb5UglgA1xtZvnCNg\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.<wbr/>org. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a&amp;utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D9c5c1ac6dc%26e%3D545b7f785a%26utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527803195578000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFlJnkvTG1ozIN_jv6X5cJdkNqYJA\">https://nutritionfacts.org/<wbr/>audio.</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Yours in evidence-based nutrition,<br/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"CToWUd\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/lmNi1pyS1se2xkwRWwjNq3X04o6ZSihCdhHIU3Q5exKP0phxhd2NfXywP1ZqYNJiDRh77nBuKpq-iaJ9Dzj-ouK76yxoVYS6KNGllidOwOQ0mMWaDcSyXT_3_6y0ww7y=s0-d-e1-ft#https://gallery.mailchimp.com/c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913/images/michael.png\" width=\"181\" height=\"84\"/><br/>\nMichael Greger, M.D. FACLM<br/>\n<a title=\"NutritionFacts.org\" href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage2.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=d176f4db57&amp;e=545b7f785a&amp;utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-&amp;mc_cid=3916c5a433&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage2.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3Dd176f4db57%26e%3D545b7f785a%26utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D3916c5a433-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2018_05_16%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-3916c5a433-%26mc_cid%3D3916c5a433%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1527803195578000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH-VgGfYxsydvnd4v9o4G-5m3ebcw\">NutritionFacts.org</a></p>"
